sequenceDiagram
    actor Listener
    participant UI
    participant API
    participant Orchestrator
    participant AI as AI Adapter
    participant Retriever
    participant Ranker
    participant Validator

    Listener->>UI: Describe current vibe
    UI->>API: Submit vibe request
    API->>Orchestrator: Interpret request
    Orchestrator->>AI: Extract structured preferences
    AI-->>Orchestrator: Preference proposal
    Orchestrator-->>UI: Reviewable interpretation
    Listener->>UI: Confirm or correct
    UI->>API: Request recommendations
    API->>Orchestrator: Generate grounded mix
    Orchestrator->>Retriever: Retrieve approved candidates
    Retriever-->>Orchestrator: Song IDs and relevance
    Orchestrator->>Ranker: Feature and hybrid scoring
    Ranker-->>Orchestrator: Ranked records and evidence
    Orchestrator->>AI: Generate from verified evidence
    AI-->>Validator: Structured explanations
    Validator-->>Orchestrator: Valid results or fallback requirement
    Orchestrator-->>API: Recommendation response
    API-->>UI: Five or fewer grounded songs
    UI-->>Listener: Display mix and explanations
